            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Side A 0.5.30

- Usage never reads over 100%: past the limit Claude reports 101%, and Side A now caps it.
- A limit that has reset shows 0% instead of its old reading.
- Resets a few seconds out read "in 1m", and the weekly alert skips weeks that already reset.

macOS 14 or later. Apple Silicon and Intel. Free.
